# Only track dashboard files
*
!index.html
# The header emblem: a transparent PNG whose white brushed ring only reads
# against the dark header. Sourced from coffee stain logo.pptx, NOT from the
# flattened jpg export, which put a white ring on white and erased it.
!ispe-emblem.png
!.gitignore
!admin.html
!data.json
!csv_to_dashboard_json.py
!admin-server.py
!build_public_payload.py
!docs/
!docs/*.md
# Self-hosted Source Serif 4 (SIL Open Font License 1.1). Committed rather than
# loaded from a CDN so the dashboard works offline and over file://, and so no
# third-party request is made on behalf of members in the EU.
!fonts/
!fonts/*.woff2
!fonts/LICENSE.txt
# NOTE: SP Plan-SurveyExport.csv is intentionally NOT allowlisted — it contains
# respondent PII (names, emails, IPs). Keep it out of the repo.
# NOTE: the newer exports (SP Reports*.csv, *-SurveyExport.csv) carry no PII, but
# they do carry free-text committee answers that are not published. They stay out
# of this repo until it is private — see docs/MIGRATION-private-repo.md.
# NOTE: public/ is the generated public payload (build_public_payload.py). It is a
# build artifact, not source, and is rebuilt on every publish.

# The reviewer site (Cloudflare Pages + Access + D1). Source only — its own
# review-site/.gitignore keeps dist/ (generated), .dev.vars (local secrets) and
# .wrangler/ (local D1 state) out. This allowlist has to name every level: with
# `*` at the top, git will not descend into a directory that is not un-ignored.
!review-site/
!review-site/*.py
!review-site/*.toml
!review-site/*.sql
!review-site/*.md
!review-site/.gitignore
!review-site/.dev.vars.example
!review-site/src/
!review-site/src/*
!review-site/lib/
!review-site/lib/*
!review-site/functions/
!review-site/functions/**
